#ASSERT `s 269.1(2) official` NOTHING      (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 269.1(2) official` NOTHING      (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 269.1(2) "torture means any act or omission by which severe pain or suffering, whether physical or mental, is intentionally inflicted on a person (a) for a purpose including (i) obtaining ... information or a statement, (ii) punishing ..., and (iii) intimidating or coercing ..., or (b) for any reason based on discrimination of any kind, but does not include any act or omission arising only from, inherent in or incidental to lawful sanctions"
--                                  severe (i)   (ii)  (iii) (b)   lawful sanctions
#ASSERT `s 269.1(2) torture` TRUE  TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
